# Control-channel script for appbardemo's sim row (testbench_rp2350, a 320x240 touch panel):
# the overflow button at the bar's right end opens the options menu (its two rows sit at
# y = 105 and 134 on the dialog card), Compose pushes the draft, whose first BACK after an
# edit is taken by its OnBackPressedCallback and whose second leaves; then the up button at
# the bar's left end leaves a second draft. Compose is at y = 104 under the inbox's status
# line, Edit at y = 76 straight under the draft's bar.
wait AppBarDemo[]:] inbox ready
input tap 300 20
sleep 1
input tap 160 134
wait AppBarDemo[]:] selected Sort by date
sleep 1
input tap 90 104
wait AppBarDemo[]:] draft ready
sleep 1
input tap 90 76
wait AppBarDemo[]:] draft: edited
input back
wait AppBarDemo[]:] draft: unsaved edit kept
input back
wait activity: pop appbardemo/DraftActivity
sleep 1
input tap 90 104
wait activity: push appbardemo/DraftActivity
sleep 1
input tap 20 20
